    "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#fetching-and-processing-a-resource-from-a-link-element:link-options-destination still states `If options's destination is null, then return null.`, however it cannot be `null`. Does that need to be updated to the empty string instead?\n\nIf that's the case, then how do we handle `fetch` as type, since that defaults to the empty string per https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-potential-destination-translate",
